{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976685690,"sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_mWTafu5a3bQNOdxBWZwrbc9u","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json","offset":1,"limit":2000},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"Most `oboInOwl:*` properties have a label that is defined in the merged import module. Therefore, there is _no_ need to relabel them in the `-edit` file.\\n\\nIn fact, relabelling those properties in the `-edit` file is a regular source of spurious diffs, because some of those properties (especially `hasDbXref`) have _several_ conflicting labels in the import module, and we can’t control which label is being used in the serialisation of the `cl-edit.owl` file.\\n\\nI had already removed the relabelling of those properties _twice_: In #3333, and then again in #3547. Now the spurious labels have been injected again in #3522.\\n\\nThey must be removed once more, and we must have a check to prevent them from being ever injected again.\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"Prevent contributors from relabelling imported annotation properties\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3588\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"Most `oboInOwl:*` properties have a label that is defined in the merged import module. Therefore, there is _no_ need to relabel them in the `-edit` file.\\n\\nIn fact, relabelling those properties in the `-edit` file is a regular source of spurious diffs, because some of those properties (especially `hasDbXref`) have _several_ conflicting labels in the import module, and we can’t control which label is being used in the serialisation of the `cl-edit.owl` file.\\n\\nI had already removed the relabelling of those properties _twice_: In #3333, and then again in #3547. Now the spurious labels have been injected again in #3522.\\n\\nThey must be removed once more, and we must have a check to prevent them from being ever injected again.\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Prevent contributors from relabelling imported annotation properties\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3588\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778976685663,"end":1778976685687}},"id":"prt_e3345fc37001Vapb50HsKkWGBR","sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","messageID":"msg_e3345f1db001YerPV4DPg3WbG3"}}
