{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976722318,"sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_sE0bNEZOQFzqfhRFo9BIQMfF","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"AnnotationAssertion\\(rdfs:label oboInOwl:","path":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl","include":"cl-edit.owl"},"output":"Found 9 matches\n/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl:\n  Line 3688: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:SubsetProperty \"subset_property\")\n\n  Line 3692: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:consider \"consider\")\n\n  Line 3696: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym \"has_broad_synonym\")\n\n  Line 3700: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"database_cross_reference\")\n\n  Line 3704: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym \"has_exact_synonym\")\n\n  Line 3708: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym \"has_narrow_synonym\")\n\n  Line 3712: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym \"has_related_synonym\")\n\n  Line 3716: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasSynonymType \"has_synonym_type\")\n\n  Line 3720: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:inSubset \"in_subset\")\n","metadata":{"matches":9,"truncated":false},"title":"AnnotationAssertion\\(rdfs:label oboInOwl:","time":{"start":1778976722301,"end":1778976722316}},"id":"prt_e33468a1f001k7DXBYQXP3nb4j","sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","messageID":"msg_e33466172001YBga7yal9Y95VS"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1778976722485,"sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","part":{"id":"prt_e3346849f001e6Ai4iOwQvzCIe","messageID":"msg_e33466172001YBga7yal9Y95VS","sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","type":"text","text":"There are eight offending `rdfs:label` assertions on `oboInOwl` properties. I’m going to remove only those label axioms from `cl-edit.owl` and add a Makefile test that fails if `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` is reintroduced.","time":{"start":1778976720031,"end":1778976722483}}}
