{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976785724,"sessionID":"ses_1ccba0f2dffeVPd0wy4yf6tXOs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_NpTsHYqIhWnoo8YJhcPFyOpp","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+The imported `oboInOwl:*` annotation property labels were removed from `cl-edit.owl`, and a local Makefile guard was added to prevent reintroducing `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axioms.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+## Summary\n+\n+This change addresses issue #3588 by removing local relabeling of imported `oboInOwl:*` annotation properties from `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+It also adds a custom Makefile guard, `test_no_oboInOwl_labels`, to fail routine tests if an `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axiom is reintroduced into `cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The `oboInOwl:*` annotation properties are imported and already labeled by imported modules. Keeping local labels in `cl-edit.owl` can cause spurious serialization diffs, especially for properties such as `hasDbXref` that may have conflicting imported labels.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- Removed all `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axioms from `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Added `test_no_oboInOwl_labels` to `src/ontology/cl.Makefile`.\n+- Included the new guard in the custom `test` dependencies.\n+- Verified no matching `oboInOwl` label assertions remain in `cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Ran `make test_no_oboInOwl_labels` successfully.\n+- Ran `git diff --check` for the edited files.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+The imported `oboInOwl:*` annotation property labels were removed from `cl-edit.owl`, and a local Makefile guard was added to prevent reintroducing `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axioms.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+This change addresses issue #3588 by removing local relabeling of imported `oboInOwl:*` annotation properties from `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+It also adds a custom Makefile guard, `test_no_oboInOwl_labels`, to fail routine tests if an `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axiom is reintroduced into `cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The `oboInOwl:*` annotation properties are imported and already labeled by imported modules. Keeping local labels in `cl-edit.owl` can cause spurious serialization diffs, especially for properties such as `hasDbXref` that may have conflicting imported labels.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- Removed all `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axioms from `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Added `test_no_oboInOwl_labels` to `src/ontology/cl.Makefile`.\n+- Included the new guard in the custom `test` dependencies.\n+- Verified no matching `oboInOwl` label assertions remain in `cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Ran `make test_no_oboInOwl_labels` successfully.\n+- Ran `git diff --check` for the edited files.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+The imported `oboInOwl:*` annotation property labels were removed from `cl-edit.owl`, and a local Makefile guard was added to prevent reintroducing `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axioms.\n","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"PR_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+This change addresses issue #3588 by removing local relabeling of imported `oboInOwl:*` annotation properties from `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+It also adds a custom Makefile guard, `test_no_oboInOwl_labels`, to fail routine tests if an `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axiom is reintroduced into `cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The `oboInOwl:*` annotation properties are imported and already labeled by imported modules. Keeping local labels in `cl-edit.owl` can cause spurious serialization diffs, especially for properties such as `hasDbXref` that may have conflicting imported labels.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- Removed all `AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:...)` axioms from `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Added `test_no_oboInOwl_labels` to `src/ontology/cl.Makefile`.\n+- Included the new guard in the custom `test` dependencies.\n+- Verified no matching `oboInOwl` label assertions remain in `cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Ran `make test_no_oboInOwl_labels` successfully.\n+- Ran `git diff --check` for the edited files.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n","additions":20,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated